*.log
*.tmp

# ── Editors / tooling ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
.claude/

# ── Secrets: real .env values are never committed; *.example templates are ─
.env
**/.env
!**/*.env.example
!.env.multi.example
